# UI Components Library

This document provides a comprehensive overview of all available UI components in the library.

## Basic Components

### Button
Location: `@3a.solutions/ui/button`
```tsx
import { Button, ButtonGroup } from '@3a.solutions/ui/button'
```
- Variants: primary, default, destructive, outline, secondary, ghost, link
- Sizes: default, sm, lg, icon
- Sub-components: ButtonGroup

### Badge
Location: `@3a.solutions/ui/badge`
```tsx
import { Badge } from '@3a.solutions/ui/badge'
```
- Variants: default, primary, secondary, destructive, outline

### BadgeSelect
Location: `@3a.solutions/ui/badge-select`
```tsx
import { BadgeSelect } from '@3a.solutions/ui/badge-select'
```
- Combines Badge with Select functionality
- Supports all Badge variants
- Includes placeholder and disabled states

