## Interactive Components

### Command
Location: `@3a.solutions/ui/command`
```tsx
import { Command, CommandInput, CommandList, CommandItem } from '@3a.solutions/ui/command'
```
- Sub-components: CommandInput, CommandList, CommandItem, CommandGroup, CommandEmpty, CommandShortcut

### Switch
Location: `@3a.solutions/ui/switch`
```tsx
import { Switch } from '@3a.solutions/ui/switch'
```

### Slider
Location: `@3a.solutions/ui/slider`
```tsx
import { Slider, RangeSlider } from '@3a.solutions/ui/slider'
```
- Components:
  - `Slider`: Single value slider
  - `RangeSlider`: Multi-value range slider
  - `SliderTicks`: Optional ticks display (internal)
- Features:
  - Horizontal and vertical orientation
  - Customizable min/max/step values
  - Optional ticks with custom labels
  - Accessible through keyboard navigation
  - Touch-friendly

